  "description": "MODERN SERIF BUNDLE – 15 High-Quality Serif Fonts by Denustudios\nUnlock ultimate versatility, high-fashion poise, and editorial luxury with the Modern Serif Bundle by Denustudios! Packed with 15 premium serif fonts in one collection, this suite features a stunning variety of aesthetics—from high-contrast display serifs and sleek condensed ligatures to fancy classic letterforms and modern minimalist shapes. It gives you an incredible typographic toolbox to create timeless, high-end designs without ever running out of inspiration.\nIdeal for luxury brand logos, fashion magazine covers, boutique packaging, editorial layouts, wedding invitations, quote poster prints, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>MODERN SERIF BUNDLE – 15 High-Quality Serif Fonts by Denustudios</p>\n<p>Unlock ultimate versatility, high-fashion poise, and editorial luxury with the Modern Serif Bundle by Denustudios! Packed with 15 premium serif fonts in one collection, this suite features a stunning variety of aesthetics—from high-contrast display serifs and sleek condensed ligatures to fancy classic letterforms and modern minimalist shapes. It gives you an incredible typographic toolbox to create timeless, high-end designs without ever running out of inspiration.</p>\n<p>Ideal for luxury brand logos, fashion magazine covers, boutique packaging, editorial layouts, wedding invitations, quote poster prints, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
